/TITLE, Solid cantilever 200 x 20 x 20 mm, end load
! Hand check: tip deflection PL^3/(3EI) + shear = about 0.41 mm (UY)
/PREP7
ET,1,SOLID185
KEYOPT,1,2,3            ! simplified enhanced strain
MP,EX,1,210000          ! N/mm2
MP,PRXY,1,0.3
MP,DENS,1,7.85e-9
BLOCK,0,200,0,20,0,20
ESIZE,4
VMESH,ALL
FINISH
/SOLU
ANTYPE,STATIC
NSEL,S,LOC,X,0
D,ALL,ALL,0
NSEL,S,LOC,X,200
*GET,nload,NODE,0,COUNT
F,ALL,FY,-1000/nload    ! 1 kN total
ALLSEL
SOLVE
FINISH
/POST1
*GET,ntip,NODE,0,NUM,MAX
PLNSOL,U,SUM
*GET,umax,PLNSOL,0,MAX
PLNSOL,S,EQV
*GET,smax,PLNSOL,0,MAX
NSEL,S,LOC,X,0
PRRSOL
ALLSEL
/COM, Maximum displacement and von Mises stress:
*VWRITE,umax,smax
(2E14.5)
